    retained: 'Muslim Travel OS positioning; Muslim travellers and mixed-faith groups; Team Ds Gang.',
    body: `<div class="cover-copy"><p class="overline">AI travel copilot</p><h1>Safar<span>.</span></h1><h2>The Muslim<br>Travel OS</h2><p class="lead">Prayer-aware planning, halal discovery<br>and group decisions in one workspace.</p><div class="team"><b>Team Ds Gang</b><span>Chong Pohyi · Teoh Xi Xian · Tan Wei Feng</span></div></div><figure class="cover-visual">${picture('prototype/mobile_app_hero.png', 'Safar prototype mobile interface')}<figcaption>Original prototype interface</figcaption></figure>`,
    script: `Good day, judges. We are Team Ds Gang, and this is Safar: the Muslim Travel OS. We bring prayer-aware scheduling, halal discovery and mixed-group decisions into one shared travel workspace. Our goal is simple: help friends travel together while respecting what each person needs from the trip.`,
